{"slug":"/references/medusa-workflows/steps/getLineItemPricingQuantitiesStep","title":"getLineItemPricingQuantitiesStep - Medusa Core Workflows Reference","frontmatter":{"slug":"/references/medusa-workflows/steps/getLineItemPricingQuantitiesStep","sidebar_label":"getLineItemPricingQuantitiesStep","tags":["cart","step"]},"toc":[{"title":"Example","id":"example","level":2},{"title":"Input","id":"getlineitempricingquantitiesstep-input","level":2},{"title":"Output","id":"getlineitempricingquantitiesstep-output","level":2}],"blocks":[{"kind":"markdown","html":"This documentation provides a reference to the `getLineItemPricingQuantitiesStep`. It belongs to the `@medusajs/medusa/core-flows` package."},{"kind":"markdown","html":"This step resolves the quantity that each item added to a cart must be priced\nfor. When an item is merged into an existing line item of the cart, its price\nhas to be selected for the resulting total quantity, not only for the added\nquantity. Otherwise, quantity-based prices (such as price list tiers) are\nresolved against the wrong quantity.\n\nThe returned quantities are aligned, by index, with the input items."},{"kind":"heading","level":2,"text":"Example","id":"example"},{"kind":"markdown","html":"```ts\nconst quantities = getLineItemPricingQuantitiesStep({\n  \"id\": \"cart_123\",\n  \"items\": [{\n    \"variant_id\": \"variant_123\",\n    \"quantity\": 1,\n  }]\n})\n```"},{"kind":"heading","level":2,"text":"Input","id":"getlineitempricingquantitiesstep-input"},{"kind":"typeList","sectionTitle":"getLineItemPricingQuantitiesStep","openedLevel":1,"types":[{"name":"GetLineItemPricingQuantitiesStepInput","type":"[GetLineItemPricingQuantitiesStepInput](/references/core_flows/core_core_flows_src/interfaces/core_flows.core_core_flows_src.GetLineItemPricingQuantitiesStepInput)","optional":false,"defaultValue":"","description":"","expandable":false,"children":[{"name":"GetLineItemPricingQuantitiesStepInput","type":"`object`","description":"The details of the items to resolve pricing quantities for.","optional":false,"defaultValue":"","expandable":false,"children":[]}]}]},{"kind":"heading","level":2,"text":"Output","id":"getlineitempricingquantitiesstep-output"},{"kind":"typeList","sectionTitle":"getLineItemPricingQuantitiesStep","openedLevel":1,"types":[{"name":"number[]","type":"`number`[]","optional":false,"defaultValue":"","description":"","expandable":false,"children":[{"name":"number","type":"`number`","optional":false,"defaultValue":"","description":"","expandable":false,"children":[]}]}]}]}